source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Jira skips the spaces before a marker run and indents the list by none of them, so jiro drops the indent too.
-- input.jira --
 * item
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>item</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- item
-- warnings.json --
[]
